    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IS THIS FOR YOU?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy cozy, relaxing indie games <i>and</i> love a good challenge with clever puzzles to solve, then <strong>Nested</strong> is for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW DOES IT WORK?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you\u2019ll progress through multiple levels filled with puzzles. Each puzzle is solved by stacking the correct combination of nesting dolls and matching the right sizes and colors on each stack nodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/261b0b1c294aff59c9d25302b659ccac.poster.avif?t=1750135128\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/261b0b1c294aff59c9d25302b659ccac.webm?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/261b0b1c294aff59c9d25302b659ccac.mp4?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nesting dolls can also interact with objects based on their size and color. For example, a pink door will let a pink nesting doll pass through, but not a yellow one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/ea561605aa66355e4b24ac156fc9f27d.poster.avif?t=1750135128\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/ea561605aa66355e4b24ac156fc9f27d.webm?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/ea561605aa66355e4b24ac156fc9f27d.mp4?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In some levels, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>Buttons</strong> with various effects. Some let you <strong>Invert</strong> your stack's colors, others make you <strong>Grow</strong> or <strong>Shrink</strong>, and some even spawn new nesting dolls. The possibilities are almost endless! Certain buttons also open doors\u00a0 \u2014 or even open up other nesting dolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a nesting doll is open and larger than you, you can enter it. If it\u2019s closed or smaller, you may be able to push it \u2014 unless it\u2019s already occupied by another smaller doll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/f4f9dd94ccc841f510e0071cf90d27a9.poster.avif?t=1750135128\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/f4f9dd94ccc841f510e0071cf90d27a9.webm?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/f4f9dd94ccc841f510e0071cf90d27a9.mp4?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also discover other mechanics, like <strong>Swap Nodes</strong> that let you switch the currently playable doll, or <strong>Bombs</strong> that let you destroy other nesting dolls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/05b933ba47a300981432c25c636888ed.poster.avif?t=1750135128\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/05b933ba47a300981432c25c636888ed.webm?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/05b933ba47a300981432c25c636888ed.mp4?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nested</strong> was created during the GMTK Game Jam 2024, organized by Mark Brown, and was selected as one of the 20 winners of that year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is <strong>Nathan</strong>, and I\u2019m the sole developer behind it. I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I enjoyed making it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IS THIS FOR YOU?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy cozy, relaxing indie games <i>and</i> love a good challenge with clever puzzles to solve, then <strong>Nested</strong> is for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW DOES IT WORK?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you\u2019ll progress through multiple levels filled with puzzles. Each puzzle is solved by stacking the correct combination of nesting dolls and matching the right sizes and colors on each stack nodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/261b0b1c294aff59c9d25302b659ccac.poster.avif?t=1750135128\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/261b0b1c294aff59c9d25302b659ccac.webm?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/261b0b1c294aff59c9d25302b659ccac.mp4?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nesting dolls can also interact with objects based on their size and color. For example, a pink door will let a pink nesting doll pass through, but not a yellow one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/ea561605aa66355e4b24ac156fc9f27d.poster.avif?t=1750135128\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/ea561605aa66355e4b24ac156fc9f27d.webm?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/ea561605aa66355e4b24ac156fc9f27d.mp4?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In some levels, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>Buttons</strong> with various effects. Some let you <strong>Invert</strong> your stack's colors, others make you <strong>Grow</strong> or <strong>Shrink</strong>, and some even spawn new nesting dolls. The possibilities are almost endless! Certain buttons also open doors\u00a0 \u2014 or even open up other nesting dolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a nesting doll is open and larger than you, you can enter it. If it\u2019s closed or smaller, you may be able to push it \u2014 unless it\u2019s already occupied by another smaller doll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/f4f9dd94ccc841f510e0071cf90d27a9.poster.avif?t=1750135128\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/f4f9dd94ccc841f510e0071cf90d27a9.webm?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/f4f9dd94ccc841f510e0071cf90d27a9.mp4?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also discover other mechanics, like <strong>Swap Nodes</strong> that let you switch the currently playable doll, or <strong>Bombs</strong> that let you destroy other nesting dolls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/05b933ba47a300981432c25c636888ed.poster.avif?t=1750135128\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/05b933ba47a300981432c25c636888ed.webm?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752780/extras/05b933ba47a300981432c25c636888ed.mp4?t=1750135128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nested</strong> was created during the GMTK Game Jam 2024, organized by Mark Brown, and was selected as one of the 20 winners of that year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is <strong>Nathan</strong>, and I\u2019m the sole developer behind it. I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I enjoyed making it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Nested is a cute grid-based puzzle game made around the concept of russian nesting dolls.\u00a0\u00a0 Come twist your brain as you stack, push and interact with the various objects you'll find in each levels. Let's see if you can reach the right combination of nesting dolls to solve every one of them!",
